MODULE: ExclusiveWorkCompetitorIgnoresResize
TARGET: ExclusiveWork
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a migration or legacy import ignores the published resize intent
PERTURBS: CompetitorAdmit

--- FIND
    /\ resize \notin {"announced", "active"} /\ undo \in {"idle", "done"}
--- REPLACE
    /\ undo \in {"idle", "done"}
--- END
